left-acting and right-acting geometric distortions.\>\"", ",", "\"\<\>\"", 
         ",", "\"\<Synthetic holonomy:\>\"", ",", 
         "\"\<Generated from the non-Abelian connection A(t) = i [0.7 cos(t) \
sigma_x + 0.4 sin(2t) sigma_y + 0.2 sigma_z].\>\"", ",", 
         "\"\<The ODE reference is projected to the nearest unitary by polar \
decomposition before constructing the effective gates.\>\"", ",", "\"\<\>\"", 
         ",", "\"\<Left-acting convention:\>\"", ",", 
         "\"\<V_eff = U_gamma V, V_corr = Uhat^dagger V_eff.\>\"", ",", 
         "\"\<\>\"", ",", "\"\<Right-acting convention:\>\"", ",", 
         "\"\<V_eff = V U_gamma, V_corr = V_eff Uhat^dagger.\>\"", ",", 
         "\"\<\>\"", ",", "\"\<Expected behavior:\>\"", ",", 
         "\"\<Holonomy-estimation error should decrease under mesh \
refinement.\>\"", ",", 
         "\"\<Left and right correction errors should decrease under mesh \
refinement.\>\"", ",", "\"\<Correction fidelities should approach 1.\>\"", 
         ",", "\"\<Unitarity residuals should remain near machine \
precision.\>\"", ",", "\"\<\>\"", ",", "\"\<Fit summary:\>\"", ",", 
