Cell[BoxData["\<\"04_feedforward_correction.nb \
completed.\\n\\nPurpose:\\nValidate non-Abelian feed-forward correction for \
both left-acting and right-acting geometric distortions.\\n\\nSynthetic \
holonomy:\\nGenerated from the non-Abelian connection A(t) = i [0.7 cos(t) \
sigma_x + 0.4 sin(2t) sigma_y + 0.2 sigma_z].\\nThe ODE reference is \
projected to the nearest unitary by polar decomposition before constructing \
the effective gates.\\n\\nLeft-acting convention:\\nV_eff = U_gamma V, V_corr \
= Uhat^dagger V_eff.\\n\\nRight-acting convention:\\nV_eff = V U_gamma, \
V_corr = V_eff Uhat^dagger.\\n\\nExpected behavior:\\nHolonomy-estimation \
error should decrease under mesh refinement.\\nLeft and right correction \
errors should decrease under mesh refinement.\\nCorrection fidelities should \
approach 1.\\nUnitarity residuals should remain near machine \
precision.\\n\\nFit summary:\\n<|\\\"holonomy_log_log_slope\\\" -> \
-2.0085454156994187, \\\"holonomy_estimated_order\\\" -> 2.0085454156994187, \
\\\"left_correction_log_log_slope\\\" -> -2.0085454156911657, \
\\\"left_correction_estimated_order\\\" -> 2.0085454156911657, \
\\\"right_correction_log_log_slope\\\" -> -2.008545415707916, \
\\\"right_correction_estimated_order\\\" -> \
2.008545415707916|>\\n\\nReference \
diagnostics:\\n<|\\\"ode_reference_unitarity_error_before_polar_projection\\\"\
 -> 5.347411632239695*^-8, \
\\\"true_holonomy_unitarity_error_after_polar_projection\\\" -> \
3.925231146709438*^-17, \\\"target_gate_unitarity_error\\\" -> \
3.3823104336622004*^-16, \\\"left_effective_gate_unitarity_error\\\" -> \
2.8576114088871287*^-16, \\\"right_effective_gate_unitarity_error\\\" -> \
4.827396019292964*^-16, \\\"true_holonomy_eigenphases\\\" -> \
{-0.7013416583093253, 0.7013416583093254}, \
\\\"true_holonomy_wilson_traces_r1_r2_r3\\\" -> {1.527954358309696 + \
5.551115123125783*^-17*I, 0.33464452107759485 + 0.*I, -1.016632803844724 - \
1.1102230246251565*^-16*I}|>\\n\\nGenerated \
files:\\n/Users/njblost/GitHub/Non-Abelian-Wilczek-Zee-holonomy-calibration-\
and-feed-forward-for-time-bin-qudits/results/tables/04_feedforward_correction.\
